hive/66905717b76943a202377217a41dfb443f3760dc.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;今年是食贫道做电商的第6个年头了，这期和大家聊聊食贫道为什么要做电商，这些年我们都做了什么。也正式和大家介绍下我们和@蓝盒子睡眠 一起研发的出行好物旅行颈枕。在2000多位小伙伴的认真建议和@POLLYPOLYMER博理科技 的技术支持下，历经7个月的研发，这款旅行枕终于和大家见面啦~其实舒服好用的颈枕一直是我们外出拍摄的刚需，食贫道一年有超过200天在外拍摄，非常需要在各种环境能快速休养精力。希望这款颈枕也能帮助到有相似需求的你~</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MEkjBeEY1</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MEkjBeEY1</guid><pubDate>Tue, 20 Jan 2026 12:10:33 GMT</pubDate><author>食贫道</author></item><item><title>江西，我愿称其为下饭界的“概念神”！【长江吃饭故事07】</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115910228709372&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1QwrSB8EVN" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/1b4df80f94a28570ffbf4fa3f6886f95645d248e.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1QwrSB8EVN</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1QwrSB8EVN</guid><pubDate>Sat, 17 Jan 2026 11:47:27 GMT</pubDate><author>食贫道</author></item><item><title>来B站，一起学习引爆炸弹</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115864443683232&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1CArTBfELR" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7944ac9f7ef885bbe4e8d8c625687e3bd9a5c1a1.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1CArTBfELR</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1CArTBfELR</guid><pubDate>Fri, 09 Jan 2026 10:00:11 GMT</pubDate><author>食贫道</author></item><item><title>战 后 八 十 年</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mob